        "PMC13208696::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The resulting protective oxide scale is coherent, slow-growing, and adherent.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC13067856::web::013::results",
        "PMC13208696::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "A Cr2O3 or Cr-containing protective scale suppresses outward Mn diffusion and Mn depletion.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10384371::web::027::4_3_oxidation_in_air",
        "PMC11169556::web::002::introduction",
        "PMC13208696::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Alloys below the proposed reactive-element threshold form Mn-rich spinel oxides.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10384371::web::027::4_3_oxidation_in_air",
        "PMC11169556::web::002::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mn-rich spinel scales are rapidly growing and non-protective.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10384371::web::027::4_3_oxidation_in_air",
        "PMC11169556::web::002::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Atmospheric oxidation of CoCrFeNiMn alloys produces a Cr-rich inner oxide and Mn-rich outer oxide through outward cation diffusion.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11169556::web::002::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "High Mn mobility and favorable Mn oxide formation can deplete Mn, produce pores, and accelerate oxide growth.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11169556::web::002::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed governing behavior holds from 700 to 1100 °C over oxygen partial pressures ranging from near vacuum to air.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11169556::web::002::introduction",
        "PMC13208696::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Oxide-scale composition, compactness, adhesion, and growth kinetics govern alloy durability during oxidation.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC13208696::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reactive-element enrichment can improve scale adhesion and reduce oxidation rates.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC13067856::web::013::results"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cr alloying promotes formation of a thermodynamically stable protective Cr2O3 scale.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
